@INPROCEEDINGS{Heikkinen2025-mk,
  title     = "Does the order of the assignments affect the dropout rate?",
  author    = "Heikkinen, Sami",
  booktitle = "2025 International Conference on Education Technology and
               Computers (ICETC)",
  publisher = "IEEE",
  pages     = "400--405",
  abstract  = "Online learning requires different types of learning support.
               Learning analytics (LA) studies have focused on support for
               students. In contrast, few studies use LA to identify learning
               design elements that could hinder the learning process, i.e.,
               learning bottlenecks. This study aims to find more evidence for
               this purpose. The quasi-experimental research (n = 228) compares
               two consecutive course implementations that differ in the
               assignment order. The assignment order can improve the dropout
